    /// 4. Bottom-Left: Cyberpunk 2077 D-Pad widget (Phone [T], Vehicle [V], Scan [TAB]) and
    ///    compact quick item slots (MaxDoc [X] with count, Gadget [G] with count).
    /// 5. Bottom-Right: Floating contextual action prompts ("Draw Weapon [TAB]", "Crouch [C]")
    ///    with red posture stance silhouette.
    /// 6. Center: Minimalist unobtrusive crosshair dot.
    /// </summary>
